1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:47,000
<i>Lady Li, the Empress Dowager</i>
<i>has urgently summoned Noble Lady Wu'an.</i>

4
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,560
<i>If Her Majesty discovers the truth,</i>

5
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,760
<i>Lady Rao will surely be charged</i>
<i>with deceiving the sovereign.</i>

6
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,720
<i>I know I've sinned.</i>

7
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:56,160
I deserve death!

8
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,200
Good.

9
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:02,040
If you confess and name the mastermind,

10
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,800
I can show leniency and spare your life.

11
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,800
Her Majesty is seeing Noble Lady Wu'an.

12
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,560
- Your Ladyship, please wait here.
- Noble Lady Wu'an is here.

13
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,040
Her Majesty will surely
summon Her Ladyship.

14
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,000
Step aside at once.

15
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:17,560
I previously insisted that
Han Liao answer for his frame-up,

16
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,560
CHANGLE PALACE

17
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,960
which inevitably implicated Prince Rong

18
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,440
and incurred Your Majesty's wrath.

19
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,640
I deeply regret it.

20
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,880
But the Lu family has served
with utter devotion

21
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,160
and is revered by the people.

22
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,400
If such a treacherous villain
went unpunished,

23
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,440
loyal ministers and generals
would lose heart,

24
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,480
and both imperial dignity and the law
would be undermined.

25
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,480
His Majesty set aside family ties
and ruled impartially.

26
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,920
That is true concern for his brother,

27
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:43,680
sparing Prince Rong
from condemnation by the people.

28
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,840
You certainly have a glib tongue.

29
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,800
That's not what I'm asking about.

30
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:56,560
- So that's what this is about.
- What is?

31
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:00,440
Before I came to the palace,
the Duke summoned me personally.

32
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,440
Fearing Your Majesty
might turn your anger on me,

33
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:05,520
he insisted on bringing the entire Lu clan
to the palace gates to seek justice.

34
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,120
I reassured him

35
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,560
that Your Majesty
was wise and magnanimous,

36
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:13,240
that you knew
His Majesty's judgment was farsighted,

37
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:17,040
so you wouldn't possibly punish
an innocent woman over this one case.

38
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:20,520
What's all this nonsense
you're going on about?

39
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,400
Well said.

40
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,120
Step aside.

41
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,040
Greetings, Your Majesty.

42
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,200
May Your Majesty enjoy endless joy.

43
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,360
You've only just been made
Lady of Bright Deportment,

44
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,800
and already you've forgotten your bounds.

45
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,320
You even dare to barge into my palace now?

46
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,880
Your Majesty,

47
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:50,240
I heard Noble Lady Wu'an
was suddenly summoned to the palace.

48
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:53,000
I assumed Your Majesty took pity on us,
mother and daughter,

49
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,360
for being apart for so many days,

50
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,760
and called her here so we could reunite.

51
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,160
I was so delighted that
I forgot my manners.

52
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,960
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

53
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,600
Since you're here, stay and listen.

54
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:13,760
Lately, in the capital,
a rumor has been spreading wildly.

55
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:18,920
Someone secretly reported that
the Wei family used a lowborn girl

56
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,160
to impersonate a noblewoman

57
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:25,320
and fraudulently obtain titles and rewards
while deceiving the sovereign.

58
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:30,120
I'm innocent! Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

59
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,280
Even censors identify themselves
when bringing charges at court.

60
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,680
This accusation was made anonymously.

61
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,840
A malicious scoundrel must be behind it!

62
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,760
I don't even need Your Majesty
to hint at it.

63
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,320
I know who made the accusation.

64
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,640
It must be that villain Han Liao,
holding grudges,

65
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,840
- who fabricated these charges!
- You…

66
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,200
To find excuses to search
the Lu's ancestral temple,

67
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,760
he had forced someone to make all kinds
of false accusations against me.

68
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,000
The men of the Lu family were outraged,

69
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,200
which is why he received such a beating.

70
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,120
My birth father died for the country,

71
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,480
and his name
will be honored for generations.

72
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,360
The Lu family is also famed
throughout the realm

73
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,480
for generations of loyalty.

74
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:04,880
How dare that villain utter
such vile slander?

75
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:05,960
I will never let him off!

76
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:09,080
Your Majesty,
just summon that villain here.

77
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,960
I'll confront him face-to-face.

78
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,800
If a single word he says
in this hall is false,

79
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,760
please clear my name
and put justice above kinship

80
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,480
by sentencing him to death!

81
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,000
His Majesty knew I had been wronged,

82
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,960
so he sentenced that man to hard labor.

83
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,880
He bowed and begged for mercy.

84
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,520
He even offered gold to buy his way out.

85
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,040
So it was all an act.

86
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,360
How I regret it.

87
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:37,720
Had I known he was still scheming
and utterly unrepentant,

88
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,960
I shouldn't have held back
with that cauldron.

89
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:43,080
I should've just smashed that villain
to death with it.

90
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:45,160
Who knows how many lives
would've been saved?

91
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,400
Outrageous!

92
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,560
Exactly! Outrageous!

93
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:51,200
What a treacherous, shameless villain!

94
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:54,160
No wonder Your Majesty
is indignant on my behalf.

95
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,360
Everyone knows Your Majesty
is wise and just,

96
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,320
never showing favoritism.

97
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:01,960
You would never believe his slander
against an innocent woman.

98
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,600
When I next see His Majesty,

99
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,360
I'll lodge a serious complaint against him
and have him flogged half to death!

100
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:16,000
I've been falsely accused
and lost my composure.

101
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,520
Please forgive me!

102
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:20,080
- You…
- You silly girl,

103
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:22,280
you're far too guileless.

104
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,320
Get up.

105
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:27,680
Her Majesty summoned you

106
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:31,360
simply because she wanted to meet
the newly titled Noble Lady Wu'an.

107
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:34,480
She was only testing your nerve just now.

108
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,520
The memorials denouncing the Han family

109
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,960
weigh over 120 jin.

110
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,840
The Xuanshi Palace
can barely hold them all.

111
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,560
If Han Liao dares slander you again,

112
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:45,040
His Majesty will surely punish
the Han family severely.

113
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:49,960
Rao, His Majesty
has made you a Noble Lady.

114
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,160
You should go thank him for his grace.

115
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:01,360
After paying my respects to Your Majesty,

116
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:04,160
I should indeed go to Xuanshi Palace
to thank His Majesty.

117
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,640
Lady Li, you've grown very bold.

118
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,200
You're even giving orders
in my palace now?

119
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,280
I wouldn't dare.

120
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,560
Please instruct me, Your Majesty.

121
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,760
I'm tired.

122
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,680
Thank you for the gift, Your Majesty.

123
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,560
All this noise is giving me a headache.

124
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,760
Take your daughter and go.

125
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,120
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

126
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,200
CHANGLE PALACE

127
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,360
Mother,

128
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,760
you never should've listened
to Han Liao's slander.

129
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,320
He stormed the Lu family's
ancestral temple

130
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,960
and was beaten half to death.

131
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,760
The entire capital sees him as a joke now.

132
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:46,760
I summoned that Wei Rao
because I wasn't sure

133
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,240
whether to believe it.

134
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:56,160
Lady Li and her daughter
don't look much alike.

135
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:59,360
They say Lady Wei Rao
takes after her father.

136
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,960
She must resemble
her father's side of the family.

137
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:07,080
That rude and uncouth manner of hers,

138
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,800
that willful, arrogant tone,

139
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:12,720
and her deceitful, scheming nature…

140
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,440
She's exactly like that woman.

141
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:19,600
Shameless and impossible to reason with.

142
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,800
She must be her own daughter.

143
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,360
There's no evidence at all.

144
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,320
Mother, don't let the Han family
drag you into this mess.

145
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,760
Think about it.
If that girl weren't Lady Li's daughter,

146
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,960
why would she rush over to help?

147
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,160
From now on,
if Han Liao comes spouting nonsense again,

148
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,040
just have him thrown out.

149
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:40,360
Those two women are equally insufferable.

150
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,160
Don't let either of them in again.

151
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:58,920
Things have gone too far to undo.

152
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,040
This is all your fault.

153
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:03,000
At this point,

154
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:05,640
the marriage alliance between
Wei and Lu is in name only.

155
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,600
My daughter

156
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:10,320
no longer needs a husband
from the Lu family.

157
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,680
But you

158
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:14,520
will have to pay for this.

159
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,160
If I truly decide to act,

160
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,560
don't think Lu Zhuo can protect you.

161
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:23,200
What do you intend to do, Your Ladyship?

162
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,440
You're a clever girl.

163
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:29,800
You've hidden your mother
and your siblings very well.

164
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,960
Your mother has had tuberculosis

165
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,600
for over ten years.

166
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:44,120
She's gravely ill.

167
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:49,600
There are very few people in the world
who can treat her.

168
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:53,840
Medicinal herbs
that can prolong her life are rarer still.

169
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,720
With those two clues,

170
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:59,640
I can certainly find her
even if it means searching high and low.

171
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,680
Within a month at most,

172
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:06,280
I'll have your mother
brought to the capital

173
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,040
to see you one last time.

174
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,400
How does that sound?

175
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,200
Your Ladyship,

176
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,200
you're forcing me to kill myself.

177
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,280
But seeing what happened
in the hall today,

178
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,640
you know the situation perfectly well.

179
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,240
If you insist on fighting me
to the bitter end,

180
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,560
someone else may reap the benefit.

181
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,480
A torn net can be mended,

182
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:34,720
but a life lost can't be restored.

183
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,760
Even if this reaches His Majesty,

184
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:39,080
with the position I hold today,

185
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,960
I can certainly protect my daughter.

186
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:43,040
But in this world,

187
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,680
who would come for you?

188
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:48,440
And who could save you?

189
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:57,120
Your days are numbered.

190
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,960
Take your own life

191
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,760
and at least leave your body intact.

192
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,560
XIANZHUANG

193
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:27,080
These pastries are delicious.

194
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,480
I brought them especially for you.

195
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,640
I don't want any.

196
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,840
Look at you.

197
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:37,800
You've been at this country estate
less than half a month,

198
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,200
and you've been this skinny.

199
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:43,200
Just listen to me and come home with me.

200
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,240
Go home?

201
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:50,000
So they can lock me up again

202
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,160
and make me live like a dog?

203
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:56,440
That heartless old woman
keeps siding with outsiders.

204
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:59,440
In all the time I've been at Xianzhuang,

205
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:00,840
has she even asked about me once?

206
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,400
I see her for what she is now.

207
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:07,080
All she cares about
is reputation and status.

208
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,200
She's terrified I'll tarnish
the family's good name

209
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:13,200
and has no affection for me
as a granddaughter at all.

210
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,640
She expects me to go back and apologize?

211
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,840
In her dreams.

212
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,560
All right, all right.

213
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:20,600
We won't go back.

214
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,920
Grandmother may have wronged you,

215
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,000
but I've always doted on you.

216
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:30,320
Then would you

217
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,000
defy that old woman for me?

218
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,600
My child,

219
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:40,200
what wouldn't I do for you?

220
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:47,960
Your father and I were twins.

221
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,040
We were much closer
than ordinary siblings.

222
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:57,000
After he died, I swore
never to celebrate my birthday again.

223
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,640
I also keep a vegetarian diet
and pray for him.

224
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:04,560
You know I've never been
blessed with children,

225
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:07,280
so I've long seen you as my own child.

226
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,080
What is there I wouldn't do for you?

227
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,840
Don't worry.

228
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:13,600
No matter what happens,

229
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,920
I'll always stand firmly by your side.

230
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:20,920
Aunt Heng'e,
you're the one who loves me most.

231
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:27,800
Seeing you like this breaks my heart.

232
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:31,240
I made all these pastries myself.

233
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:34,120
Promise me you'll eat a little, all right?

234
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,120
- Grandmother.
- Sit.

235
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:53,040
Look into that girl named A-Chou.

236
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:55,000
I've already investigated her background.

237
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:55,920
No.

238
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,160
Investigate again.

239
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,320
Don't just investigate her.

240
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:03,760
Look into her parents
and younger siblings too.

241
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,640
Find out where the family moved from,

242
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:10,520
what trade they lived by,

243
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,600
and which households they worked for.

244
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:15,800
The people in that compound may be gone,

245
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:19,480
but her family
lived in the capital for years,

246
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,960
so there must be traces left behind.

247
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:26,200
I want every household checked thoroughly.

248
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,520
Don't miss a single detail.

249
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,040
Understood, Grandmother.

250
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,160
Do it yourself.

251
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:36,080
Remember, not a word of this can get out.

252
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,200
Most importantly,

253
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,400
don't let Rao know.

254
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:46,000
XIANZHUANG

255
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:48,280
You two, keep watch
on the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

256
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,800
- The rest of you, come with me.
- Yes.

257
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:50,800
Brother Jue,

258
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,240
why are you out here?

259
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,600
Didn't Grandmother keep telling you
to stay in more

260
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:00,600
and avoid drawing attention?

261
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,400
Aren't they all household servants here?

262
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:07,320
You handpicked reliable people beforehand.

263
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,760
Nothing can go wrong.

264
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:12,040
Besides, I'm wearing a veil.

265
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,480
I'm only taking a stroll in the garden.

266
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:16,080
What could possibly happen?

267
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,600
You forbid me from doing this and that.

268
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:19,800
I'm about to die from boredom.

269
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,040
Fine.

270
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,920
As long as you don't leave Xianzhuang,

271
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,240
you may walk around as you please.

272
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:27,280
You seem to be in a hurry, Brother Jue.

273
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,240
Where are you going?

274
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:32,880
It's the eighth month.

275
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,400
Taxes to collect in the countryside

276
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,680
and household registers to verify.

277
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:36,640
There's a lot to do.

278
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:40,200
I'm taking some men to help. I have to go.

279
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,440
Let's go.

280
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,320
Yufeng.

281
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,440
I was just going to see Mother.

282
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,720
Would you like to come with me?

283
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:06,880
Come with me.

284
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,079
Everyone, leave us.

285
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:25,680
You've been coming here
every day to pester Mother,

286
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:28,319
weeping and begging her to bring Rao back.

287
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:31,040
But you suddenly stopped coming
these past few days.

288
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:32,600
I'm almost not used to it.

289
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:35,360
May I ask what you've been busy with?

290
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,920
Who upset you, Yufeng?

291
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,200
I'll have them beaten up for you.

292
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:47,920
I went to Xianzhuang to see Rao.

293
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,200
How foolish!

294
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:51,760
Yufeng, what did I do?

295
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:54,760
You're all so heartless,
leaving Rao there and ignoring her.

296
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:56,920
She's my brother's only child, after all.

297
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:00,680
I'm her aunt. Who could fault me
for visiting and comforting her?

298
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:03,320
Xianzhuang belongs
to the Zhou family, after all,

299
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,840
and everyone there answers to Lady Li.

300
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:09,360
The more often you visit
and the closer you seem to Rao,

301
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:11,400
the more danger you put her in.

302
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:15,560
Yufeng, aren't you being
a little alarmist?

303
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:16,960
That woman is far away in the palace.

304
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,160
Her reach can't extend that far.

305
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,360
How could she know so much?

306
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,640
Have you forgotten?

307
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,720
There's also the calculating Lady Shou'an!

308
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:27,880
She rose from an ordinary peasant woman
to a titled lady with a fief.

309
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,880
She's not as foolish as you.

310
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:32,360
If she notices
even the slightest irregularity,

311
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:37,560
both you and your precious Rao
will be in grave danger!

312
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,120
Yufeng, didn't you say

313
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:42,000
we wouldn't mention
what happened back then again?

314
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,120
My Lady,

315
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,680
the Dowager Lady wishes to see you.

316
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,120
Remember what I told you.

317
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:56,200
Be cautious in everything you say and do.

318
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,640
Don't act rashly.

319
00:18:58,520 --> 00:19:00,640
Every word you said came from the heart.

320
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,360
I'll remember it all.

321
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:10,720
My Lady, this month's accounts
have been checked.

322
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:12,400
Please take a look.

323
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:16,160
I'll look at them when I return.

324
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,800
<i>No.</i>

325
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,800
<i>If Madam finds out</i>
<i>what happened back then,</i>

326
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:28,560
<i>she'll never spare me.</i>

327
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:30,400
<i>I have to avoid this disaster.</i>

328
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:39,720
Is the ginseng soup a little bitter?

329
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:45,040
Don't hide anything from me

330
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:48,400
if you truly wish to be filial.

331
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:53,600
Mother, are your eyes getting better?

332
00:19:54,120 --> 00:19:55,280
You Ladyship,

333
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:58,040
Imperial Physician Liu performed
cataract couching with a gold needle

334
00:19:58,120 --> 00:20:00,320
and prescribed Dendrobium Vision Pills.

335
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,920
It's been half a month
since the procedure.

336
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:06,440
This morning, the Dowager Lady said
her vision suddenly cleared,

337
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:07,920
and she could finally see again.

338
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:12,120
I've been worried every day
that Imperial Physician Liu was too young

339
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:14,840
and might have harmed you
by acting too hastily.

340
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,720
Don't change the subject.

341
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:22,320
I'm asking you
whether anything else has happened lately.

342
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:27,360
Isn't your recovery wonderful news
for the entire Wei family?

343
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,120
I'll call Heng'e in

344
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:30,640
- so she can share the joy.
- Stop.

345
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:36,960
I'm asking about Wei Rao,

346
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,520
the new bride of the Duke
of Ying's household,

347
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:44,280
whom His Majesty
just made Noble Lady Wu'an.

348
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:49,520
I just didn't want
to disturb your recovery.

349
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,880
The Empress Dowager
summoned Noble Lady Wu'an.

350
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,720
Mother, forgive me for speaking plainly.

351
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:01,920
We've all done our utmost
to conceal the truth,

352
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,680
but we're only fooling ourselves.

353
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:07,120
Once word reaches His Majesty,

354
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,360
it will be beyond repair.

355
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:11,000
With the favor Lady Li enjoys,

356
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:12,560
she may protect Rao, but no more.

357
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:16,960
Besides, our family
has already fallen out with her.

358
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:18,800
For the sake of her own daughter's life,

359
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:21,960
I'm afraid she won't help us

360
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:23,920
and may even turn on us
while we're vulnerable,

361
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:28,080
making our whole family the scapegoat.

362
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:32,520
Mother, we need to decide soon.

363
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:35,440
I've lived my whole life
openly and honorably

364
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:38,680
with nothing to hide.

365
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:43,760
I never imagined I'd raise someone
who could bring ruin upon the entire clan.

366
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,480
Keep everyone in this household silent.

367
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:49,320
If anyone breathes a word of this,

368
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:51,360
don't blame me for being merciless.

369
00:21:52,320 --> 00:21:53,160
Yes.

370
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,480
Governess Wang.

371
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,440
Yes.

372
00:21:57,520 --> 00:22:00,360
Go to the Duke
of Ying's Residence yourself

373
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:02,640
and deliver something for me.

374
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:04,720
Yes.

375
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,160
Has Lady Lu returned?

376
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,440
Her Ladyship is…

377
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:12,000
His Lordship had been
waiting for Her Ladyship.

378
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:13,560
He even rushed
to the palace gates to meet her.

379
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:16,160
But she'd already left,
so he hurried back.

380
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:29,920
Can't you read the situation?

381
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:33,600
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

382
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:40,240
You still have time to…?

383
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,680
What are you two hiding for
in broad daylight?

384
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:38,560
‪Shh.

385
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,720
All right, stop staring. Let's go.

386
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:45,880
Let's leave.

387
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,400
You too. Stop looking. Come on.

388
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,080
You wicked woman.

389
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:09,080
My Lord. My Lord…

390
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:12,720
My Lord, General Qi is here.

391
00:24:19,840 --> 00:24:21,560
Long afternoon naps could bad for her.

392
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:24,160
Have a maid wake her in a little while.

393
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,680
Where's Noble Lady Wu'an?

394
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:42,480
When I left just now,
she was still napping on the couch.

395
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,720
Don't play games with me.

396
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:47,360
I have serious business with her.

397
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:49,920
Talking to me works just as well.

398
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:54,520
Lu Zhuo, you and I both know

399
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,520
Wei Rao is the one registered
in your family genealogy.

400
00:24:56,600 --> 00:24:59,000
Her birth details and background
must match that identity.

401
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:01,360
As for the woman inside,

402
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:05,800
strictly speaking,
she isn't really your wife.

403
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:08,240
I'll be frank with you.

404
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:09,600
The Hans may give up the title deeds,

405
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,200
but still held on to the lands or tenants.

406
00:25:11,280 --> 00:25:12,560
Han Liao is vicious.

407
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:14,280
He's seized control
of the only irrigation channel.

408
00:25:14,360 --> 00:25:16,240
With the water cut off,
the crops are about to die.

409
00:25:16,320 --> 00:25:17,400
Tell me that isn't serious.

410
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:19,240
This is a matter for men to settle.

411
00:25:20,120 --> 00:25:21,320
Why involve her?

412
00:25:22,080 --> 00:25:23,040
I'll go with you.

413
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:26,360
Aren't you coming?

414
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:32,400
<i>Your days are numbered.</i>

415
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:34,160
Take your own life

416
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,320
and at least leave your body intact.

417
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:48,680
Those maids are far too lazy.

418
00:25:48,760 --> 00:25:49,640
I was only gone for a moment,

419
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:52,320
and they just let
Your Ladyship sleep under the sun?

420
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:53,800
Your face is all red.

421
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:55,640
Don't blame them.

422
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:57,360
I like it.

423
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:05,720
You can't do this again.

424
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:09,120
Noble ladies have delicate skin
and can't take too much sun.

425
00:26:14,320 --> 00:26:17,280
Back when I was little,
other children, though poor,

426
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:21,600
got to grow up in their mothers' arms
and on their fathers' shoulders.

427
00:26:22,200 --> 00:26:23,640
But for as long as I can remember,

428
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:27,200
my Ma never kissed me or held me.

429
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:29,320
Whenever I was cold and hungry,

430
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:34,120
I'd lie in the sunshine,

431
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,960
pretending Ma was holding me.

432
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:39,040
It always made me feel warmer.

433
00:26:41,280 --> 00:26:42,640
Once I'd gathered enough strength,

434
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:44,840
I could get back up again.

435
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:55,760
My Lady, Old Madam Wei sent this.

436
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:58,320
She said it must be
delivered to you personally.

437
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,000
This is…

438
00:27:12,280 --> 00:27:15,000
Old Madam Wei gave me this when I visited,

439
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,720
and when I left,

440
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,800
I gave the jade pendant back.

441
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:23,360
Her second son left it for his daughter.

442
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:28,920
Why would Old Madam Wei
send you this jade pendant?

443
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,600
Her son's untimely death

444
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:37,800
is the one thing
she can never move on from.

445
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:40,840
She can't forgive her own granddaughter
for breaking faith

446
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:45,760
and putting the whole family
on the brink of disgrace and ruin.

447
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:49,040
Still less can she bear for her son,
who died on the battlefield,

448
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:51,520
to become a laughingstock.

449
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:55,880
She's telling me

450
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,720
she'll help me.

451
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:04,760
Lady Li may be powerful,

452
00:28:05,280 --> 00:28:06,760
but her reputation is not that well.

453
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:11,080
Old Madam Wei also hates her bitterly
and won't make things easy for her.

454
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:13,840
As long as you deny it to the bitter end,

455
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:15,560
with Old Madam Wei vouching for you,

456
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:17,440
there is still room to turn this around.

457
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:19,600
Unless I'm willing to sacrifice
Ma and Hongxian's lives.

458
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:24,440
There will always be a way out.

459
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:27,880
I'll find a way.

460
00:28:29,280 --> 00:28:30,720
Let me think.

461
00:28:32,560 --> 00:28:33,800
Just let me think.

462
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:54,840
Follow her.

463
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:01,000
Keep a close watch on her.

464
00:29:01,560 --> 00:29:02,880
Rest assured, Madam.

465
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,280
Let go of me!

466
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:20,080
Let go!

467
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:21,480
Who sent you?

468
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:22,840
I have money…

469
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:26,200
And who are you people?

470
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:30,160
I've started going gray.

471
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:33,920
The only comfort is

472
00:29:34,840 --> 00:29:36,920
that you can no longer see it.

473
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:54,600
Forgive me, Madam!

474
00:29:59,080 --> 00:30:01,560
Madam, that old woman
really was harboring other intentions.

475
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:04,440
Afraid what happened back then
would come to light and implicate her,

476
00:30:04,520 --> 00:30:06,000
she fled the residence
in the middle of the night.

477
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:08,520
I sent men to seize her,

478
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:12,000
but someone else abducted her on the way.

479
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:15,960
Lady Shou'an really is an old fox.

480
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:19,480
She's grown suspicious already.

481
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:23,680
Send someone to Xianzhuang at once.

482
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:28,400
Give Lady Rao a message for me.

483
00:30:44,800 --> 00:30:48,160
You're Lady Guo's most trusted governess.

484
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:51,440
Why did you flee the Earl
of Cheng'an's Residence at night?

485
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,360
Master Huo,

486
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:59,200
my husband fell ill at my country home

487
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:01,840
and sent word asking me
to come and see him.

488
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:04,520
It happened just as the household
began auditing the accounts,

489
00:31:04,600 --> 00:31:06,040
and Madam runs a strict household.

490
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:08,320
How could a servant like me
ask for extended leave?

491
00:31:08,840 --> 00:31:10,080
I slipped out quietly,

492
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:12,800
intending to visit my husband,
then return and apologize.

493
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:16,680
Please show me mercy and let me go.

494
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,440
Our families were related by marriage.

495
00:31:19,520 --> 00:31:20,920
I wouldn't dare harbor a runaway servant.

496
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:23,800
Tie her up and send her back at once.

497
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:25,920
Wait, Master Huo!

498
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,120
I'll tell you the truth!

499
00:31:28,200 --> 00:31:30,480
I'll tell you everything, Master Huo.

500
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:34,680
You get one chance.

501
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:36,760
I know

502
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:40,600
a shocking secret.

503
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:42,960
It concerns the lives of my whole family.

504
00:31:43,040 --> 00:31:44,520
I dare not let word of it get out,

505
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:46,200
unless…

506
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:48,840
unless I can speak
to Lady Shou'an herself.

507
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:52,960
Otherwise, Master Huo,
even if you have me beaten to death,

508
00:31:53,040 --> 00:31:55,200
I won't dare breathe a word.

509
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:58,520
What secret could be so grave that
you must tell my grandmother in person?

510
00:31:59,360 --> 00:32:01,440
I'm afraid once you hear it,

511
00:32:02,040 --> 00:32:04,240
you'll be too shocked
to stay on your feet.

512
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:10,480
HERON LODGE

513
00:32:17,280 --> 00:32:18,720
Has Grandmother gone to bed?

514
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:23,400
Grandmother was afraid I'd be bored,

515
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,080
and invited me to play <i>weiqi</i>.

516
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:28,480
She's such a terrible player,

517
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:29,720
yet she never admits defeat.

518
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:33,320
She got tired just now,
so she finally sent me away.

519
00:32:37,480 --> 00:32:38,960
Something urgent, Brother Jue?

520
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:42,560
There's a problem
with the estate accounts.

521
00:32:43,080 --> 00:32:44,280
I'll check with her in the morning.

522
00:32:48,320 --> 00:32:50,400
You've doted on me since we were little,

523
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,920
but somewhere along the way,

524
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:54,840
you've grown distant from me.

525
00:32:56,280 --> 00:32:58,200
Now you're even keeping things from me.

526
00:33:01,800 --> 00:33:03,560
I'm not trying to hide anything from you.

527
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,760
It's just…

528
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,240
Fine. Come with me.

529
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:20,040
Brother Jue.

530
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,760
If you trust me,

531
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:24,800
let me question her alone.

532
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:26,720
- But I promised Grandmother…
- Brother Jue,

533
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:29,920
that old woman has always
been sly and devious,

534
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,840
Cheats above, hides below. Full of lies.

535
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:34,880
She always used to side
with my third sister, Wei Chan.

536
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:36,880
Knowing I had no parents to protect me,

537
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:38,920
she'd constantly
speak ill of me to Grandmother.

538
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:42,680
Now she's demanding
to see my maternal grandmother.

539
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:45,160
Who knows what lies she'll tell about me?

540
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,200
I need to question her first.

541
00:33:47,280 --> 00:33:48,960
I tried both coaxing and threatening,

542
00:33:49,040 --> 00:33:50,480
yet I still couldn't
get a word out of her.

543
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,880
How do you plan to question her?

544
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:53,600
I have my ways.

545
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:56,200
Don't worry, Brother Jue.

546
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:59,320
You should go. Go on.

547
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:02,280
If you don't, I'll get angry.

548
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:07,320
You two, keep an eye
on that old woman inside.

549
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:08,840
Don't let her hurt Her Ladyship.

550
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:10,639
- Yes.
- Yes.

551
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,920
Take her to the rear hill.

552
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:30,080
I said I want to question her alone.

553
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:32,159
Don't you understand?

554
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:34,000
- Understood.
- Understood.

555
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:49,800
Lady Rao.

556
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:51,719
My Lady…

557
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,280
Please spare me, My Lady!

558
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,360
My Lady…

559
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:58,080
Please spare me! I don't want to die.

560
00:34:58,160 --> 00:35:01,400
You've served Aunt Yufeng
for so many years.

561
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:04,360
You should know how domineering I can be.

562
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:09,080
Every insolent old servant
in the household has learned to obey me.

563
00:35:09,160 --> 00:35:13,600
Answer what I ask you today
and tell me the truth.

564
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:16,160
If a single word is false,

565
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:18,720
I'll slice off your flesh
and feed it to the wolves.

566
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:26,280
What secret were you going
to tell my maternal grandmother?

567
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,240
Nothing. I wouldn't dare…

568
00:35:30,240 --> 00:35:31,720
If you still won't talk,

569
00:35:32,760 --> 00:35:34,320
I'll aim it at your eyes.

570
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:37,160
I'll talk!

571
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:39,200
I'll tell you.

572
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:41,840
I'll tell you everything!

573
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:46,680
My Lady, back then…

574
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:51,320
when you went missing
at the lantern market,

575
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:55,280
it was Lady Heng'e who had you abandoned!

576
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,200
Nonsense!

577
00:35:57,240 --> 00:35:59,880
- Aunt Heng'e has always treasured me…
- I swear to Heaven!

578
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:01,720
Wet Nurse Zhang,
who carried you out that day,

579
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,640
had been bribed by her.

580
00:36:04,160 --> 00:36:05,680
I saw it with my own eyes.

581
00:36:07,040 --> 00:36:07,880
Pick one.

582
00:36:09,200 --> 00:36:10,520
- Pick one for the child.
- Do you like it?

583
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:14,880
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

584
00:36:14,960 --> 00:36:16,000
YOUNG WEI RAO

585
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:17,200
Which one do you like?

586
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,920
Lady Rao's shoe is missing.
Split up and look for it.

587
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,160
- My Lady, have another look.
- Quick! Search around the back.

588
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:21,480
You two, come with me over there.

589
00:36:21,560 --> 00:36:22,480
- All right.
- Search over there.

590
00:36:22,560 --> 00:36:23,400
- Let's go this way.
- Come take a look.

591
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,280
Bravo!

592
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:25,600
Pick one.

593
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:29,360
This shoe is quite nice.

594
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:32,240
Lady Rao!

595
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:34,960
Lady Rao, where are you?

596
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:36,280
Lady Rao!

597
00:36:37,080 --> 00:36:38,520
Lady Rao!

598
00:36:41,240 --> 00:36:43,680
The Dowager Lady reported it
to the authorities.

599
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:45,800
Everyone in the city was talking about it.

600
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:47,600
The wet nurse and the guard
fled for fear of punishment

601
00:36:47,680 --> 00:36:50,120
and ran into bandits
at the South Mountain.

602
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:53,040
Both got what they deserved and died.

603
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:54,960
Neither survived.

604
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,640
Why would Aunt Heng'e do that?

605
00:36:58,720 --> 00:37:03,200
Your aunt blamed your mother for
your father's death on the battlefield,

606
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,120
so…

607
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,960
She acted rashly in a moment of anger.

608
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,760
Fortunately, you were blessed
with good fortune

609
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:10,200
and were eventually found again.

610
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:13,320
Your aunt deeply regretted it
and tried her best to make amends.

611
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:15,000
I'm only a servant.

612
00:37:15,080 --> 00:37:17,760
How could I dare say anything more?

613
00:37:17,840 --> 00:37:20,480
You insisted on seeing
my maternal grandmother

614
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:24,040
just to tell her this?

615
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,960
You kept silent all these years.

616
00:37:29,560 --> 00:37:31,600
Why speak up now?

617
00:37:32,120 --> 00:37:33,480
My Lady, there's something you don't know.

618
00:37:34,080 --> 00:37:37,000
I… I've always had a gambling problem.

619
00:37:37,520 --> 00:37:42,160
I was short of money recently
and stole some gold items from Lady Guo.

620
00:37:42,240 --> 00:37:44,680
Now Madam has started asking questions,

621
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:48,040
so I hoped to use this secret
to get some travel money

622
00:37:48,120 --> 00:37:49,680
from Lady Shou'an and return home.

623
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,840
Please show mercy, My Lady.

624
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:53,800
Please spare me!

625
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:57,880
Please don't tell Lady Heng'e.

626
00:37:57,960 --> 00:37:59,880
She'll beat me to death.

627
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:03,680
I only wanted to swindle some money.

628
00:38:03,760 --> 00:38:05,840
I never meant to hurt anyone.

629
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:09,360
My Lady, please let me go home.

630
00:38:09,440 --> 00:38:11,360
I'll kowtow to you!

631
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,360
Please let me go home!

632
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:18,040
- My Lady…
- You're scared over something so small?

633
00:38:18,120 --> 00:38:20,040
- Get up.
- Yes.

634
00:38:23,200 --> 00:38:24,800
I'll give you some money.

635
00:38:25,520 --> 00:38:26,880
Go home on your own.

636
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:31,520
You're so merciful, Lady Rao.

637
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,880
You're a living bodhisattva!

638
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,280
My Lady…

639
00:38:38,640 --> 00:38:39,600
You're lying to me.

640
00:38:39,680 --> 00:38:40,960
I'm not.

641
00:38:41,760 --> 00:38:43,720
- Please, My Lady!
- Help!

642
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:47,320
- Help!
- I did nothing!

643
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:48,920
Help!

644
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:50,440
Please don't, My Lady!

645
00:38:50,520 --> 00:38:51,680
I didn't do anything!

646
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,240
Hurry and report this to Master Huo.

647
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:00,240
- Go!
- I didn't mean to do this.

648
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:02,320
- Yes.
- I didn't mean to do this.

649
00:39:07,520 --> 00:39:08,440
<i>Aunt Yufeng said</i>

650
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:10,560
<i>you were going to complain about me</i>
<i>to my maternal grandmother.</i>

651
00:39:11,080 --> 00:39:14,320
<i>Whatever you planned to tell her,</i>
<i>I won't allow it.</i>

652
00:39:15,560 --> 00:39:17,200
<i>Since you won't tell me the truth,</i>

653
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:20,320
<i>then you can die.</i>

654
00:39:21,520 --> 00:39:24,920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

655
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:34,040
Those scoundrels dared to ambush us?

656
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:37,200
I'll bash his head in tomorrow.

657
00:39:38,200 --> 00:39:39,360
Easy!

658
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:41,800
Can't you go back to your own residence
to have that treated?

659
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:44,240
Have you no heart?

660
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,360
Forgot how I got hurt?

661
00:39:46,680 --> 00:39:48,160
My Lady, please wait.

662
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:50,360
His Lordship isn't inside.

663
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:55,240
Didn't he just return from Mount Yaowang?

664
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:56,880
I have urgent matters to talk to him.

665
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:59,320
My Lady, His Lordship really isn't inside.

666
00:40:16,160 --> 00:40:17,600
I didn't know General Qi was here.

667
00:40:17,680 --> 00:40:18,640
Forgive the intrusion.

668
00:40:19,160 --> 00:40:21,160
No harm done. It was an honest mistake.

669
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:28,880
What is it?

670
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:30,600
All right, I'm dressed.

671
00:40:35,120 --> 00:40:37,800
I heard there was trouble
at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

672
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:39,560
I came to ask what happened.

673
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:41,560
It's just displaced people
causing trouble.

674
00:40:41,640 --> 00:40:43,720
It'll be settled within a couple of days.

675
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:44,920
You needn't worry.

676
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:49,880
Those people aren't
honest farmers who lost their land.

677
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:53,080
Han Liao incited the local thugs
among them to seize the fields.

678
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:54,360
Farmers can't work on it.

679
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:57,320
He even had
the only irrigation channel blocked.

680
00:40:57,400 --> 00:41:00,200
With the water cut off,
people and livestock will die of thirst,

681
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:02,680
and the crops can't be watered.

682
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,520
Qi Zhongkai and I went there today.

683
00:41:06,480 --> 00:41:08,160
Han Liao kept hiding
and refused to face us,

684
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:10,720
using the displaced people
as human shields.

685
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:13,760
If he'd fight me head-on,
I wouldn't be afraid.

686
00:41:13,840 --> 00:41:15,000
But Lu Zhuo kept holding me back,

687
00:41:15,080 --> 00:41:17,480
leaving me unable to fight properly,
and I ended up getting hurt.

688
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:20,520
I've never suffered such humiliation
even on the battlefield.

689
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:22,520
How could I not stop you?

690
00:41:22,600 --> 00:41:25,760
Those people may be
carrying hoes and machetes,

691
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:27,280
but they're still civilians.

692
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:29,160
Farm tools aren't weapons of war.

693
00:41:29,760 --> 00:41:31,160
You're a battle-hardened general.

694
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:32,680
You don't know your own strength.

695
00:41:33,200 --> 00:41:34,040
Injured even one of them,

696
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:36,080
and you'll fall right
into Han Liao's trap.

697
00:41:37,440 --> 00:41:41,200
Then he'll step forward
to seek justice for them

698
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:43,360
and accuse Noble Lady Wu'an
of killing civilians.

699
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:45,800
You'll have dragged her into trouble.

700
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:51,200
Thank you, Lord Lu, for thinking of me

701
00:41:51,720 --> 00:41:52,720
and putting up with that villain.

702
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:57,480
And thank you, General Qi,
for standing up for me.

703
00:41:57,560 --> 00:41:59,000
I won't forget your kindness.

704
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:02,360
Enough complimenting him.

705
00:42:03,440 --> 00:42:05,000
Han Liao puts the displaced out front

706
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:07,520
and hides behind, raking in the benefits.

707
00:42:08,480 --> 00:42:10,800
Brute force alone won't solve this.

708
00:42:11,480 --> 00:42:13,120
Then I'll report him to His Majesty!

709
00:42:13,200 --> 00:42:14,040
- No, we can't.
- No, we can't.

710
00:42:19,680 --> 00:42:20,520
Absolutely not.

711
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:23,040
I may know little about politics,

712
00:42:23,640 --> 00:42:26,640
but I've heard Mother say
that since ancient times,

713
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:29,200
only daughters of princes
could be made Noble Ladies.

714
00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:33,840
I was granted the title so suddenly
that people are bound to question it.

715
00:42:35,160 --> 00:42:37,040
If I take this local unrest
to His Majesty,

716
00:42:37,920 --> 00:42:40,040
people will only say
I'm talentless and unfit

717
00:42:40,120 --> 00:42:41,920
- for such responsibility.
- But you…

718
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:44,040
Your good deeds won you
those lands and tenants,

719
00:42:44,560 --> 00:42:46,560
and His Majesty
bestowed that title on you.

720
00:42:47,240 --> 00:42:48,080
But…

721
00:42:52,680 --> 00:42:54,680
…whether you can be a good female thane

722
00:42:57,520 --> 00:42:59,360
ultimately depends on your own ability.

723
00:43:02,200 --> 00:43:03,760
A female thane.

724
00:43:10,880 --> 00:43:12,680
I like the sound of that.

725
00:43:25,160 --> 00:43:26,200
Quick, fetch the physician!

726
00:43:26,720 --> 00:43:27,560
Yes.

727
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:30,000
What exactly happened?

728
00:43:30,920 --> 00:43:33,320
This old woman
fled in the middle of the night.

729
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:36,080
She must have stolen from my family.

730
00:43:36,640 --> 00:43:38,080
I only meant to frighten her a little.

731
00:43:39,040 --> 00:43:41,280
I said I'd turn her
over to the authorities

732
00:43:41,360 --> 00:43:42,840
and have her given 30 strokes.

733
00:43:43,680 --> 00:43:45,800
Then she turned vicious
and tried to kill me.

734
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:50,160
We struggled, and she lost her footing
and tumbled down the slope.

735
00:43:54,640 --> 00:43:56,800
If you don't believe me, ask him.

736
00:43:57,880 --> 00:43:58,800
Yes.

737
00:43:58,880 --> 00:44:00,280
We saw it with our own eyes.

738
00:44:00,360 --> 00:44:02,080
That woman pulled a knife
and tried to harm Her Ladyship.

739
00:44:03,080 --> 00:44:04,160
Brother Jue,

740
00:44:06,040 --> 00:44:07,480
she's a runaway servant
from the Wei family.

741
00:44:08,160 --> 00:44:10,000
If you harbor her without permission

742
00:44:10,080 --> 00:44:12,880
and my grandmother finds out,
there'll be trouble,

743
00:44:13,480 --> 00:44:15,200
and it'll only deepen the rift
between our two families.

744
00:44:15,720 --> 00:44:17,120
In my view,

745
00:44:18,800 --> 00:44:20,840
we should carry her back
to the Wei Residence

746
00:44:20,920 --> 00:44:22,200
and hand her over to Aunt Yufeng.

747
00:44:26,600 --> 00:44:28,520
What rift?

748
00:44:29,960 --> 00:44:31,040
Grandmother.

749
00:44:36,400 --> 00:44:38,640
Didn't you go to bed already?

750
00:44:38,720 --> 00:44:40,120
What brought you here?

751
00:44:40,960 --> 00:44:43,360
Brother Jue caught a runaway servant
from the Wei family.

752
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:45,560
I was just urging him to send her back.

753
00:44:47,480 --> 00:44:49,440
The Wei family really is looking for her.

754
00:44:50,320 --> 00:44:51,400
Rao questioned her in private,

755
00:44:52,000 --> 00:44:55,560
but the woman panicked
and lost her footing on the steep slope.

756
00:44:55,640 --> 00:44:57,360
Now she looks close to death.

757
00:44:58,160 --> 00:44:59,160
Grandmother…

758
00:45:00,680 --> 00:45:01,800
Let me see her.

759
00:45:02,400 --> 00:45:03,480
Grandmother,

760
00:45:03,560 --> 00:45:05,760
the smell of blood is strong in here.

761
00:45:06,600 --> 00:45:07,600
I'm afraid it may upset you.

762
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:10,880
Why don't we wait
until the physician has checked on her?

763
00:45:10,960 --> 00:45:12,160
Then I'll let you know.

764
00:45:14,040 --> 00:45:17,400
I know you're concerned for me.

765
00:45:17,480 --> 00:45:21,720
But I have weathered
more storms than you can imagine.

766
00:45:21,800 --> 00:45:24,960
Do you think this can frighten me?

767
00:45:32,120 --> 00:45:33,440
Do you have something to say?

768
00:45:33,520 --> 00:45:35,000
Lady Shou'an is here.

769
00:45:35,080 --> 00:45:36,040
Say whatever you want to say.

770
00:45:49,880 --> 00:45:50,800
She…

771
00:45:54,520 --> 00:45:56,560
She's an impostor.

772
00:48:13,840 --> 00:48:16,600
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
